# thinkorswim.vmoptions for a VM rig, written by the Rig Manager at snapshot build from this template (7.3 step 4).
# The placeholders (heap_min, heap_max, crash_dir) are pinned per rig cell: the heap (7.1 Memory row) and the crash
# folder the Watchdog collects (10.2).
# B3 and H10 compare the sha256 of the rendered file (L-XREF-28). Phase 0 check 3 (7.14) confirms every flag against
# the bundled JDK major and whether the updater or the login-screen Setup dialog rewrites this file.
-Xms${heap_min}
-Xmx${heap_max}
-Dsun.java2d.d3d=false
-Dsun.java2d.noddraw=true
-XX:ErrorFile=${crash_dir}\hs_err_pid%p.log
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=${crash_dir}
-XX:+CreateCoredumpOnCrash
